      "text": "859. \u6c42\u4e0b\u5217\u5404\u6570\u7684\u5012\u6570\uff1a\n1) $\\frac{10}{27},\\ \\frac{12}{59},\\ \\frac{23}{98},\\ \\frac{11}{122},\\ \\frac{42}{315},\\ \\frac{10}{3},\\ \\frac{41}{8}$\uff1b\n2) $11\\frac{11}{12},\\ \\frac{1}{20}$\uff0c80\uff0c100\uff0c1\uff0c0.5\uff0c1.2.",
